{"id":"grammar-gen-p10","familyId":"grammar-gen-p10","skillIds":["grammar.tense","grammar.clause"],"level":"G1","section":"grammar","reviewMode":"recall","promptZh":"阅读短文，在空白处填入 1 个适当的单词或括号内单词的正确形式。","resourceId":"grammar-gen-res-p10","estimatedSeconds":300,"sourceIds":["tool-generated-practice"],"explanation":{"summaryZh":"语法填空：先通读确定时态主线，再逐空判断词性与从句结构。","ruleZh":"括号给词考词形转换，无词处多考功能词。","evidence":[{"resourceId":"grammar-gen-res-p10","paragraphId":"p1","quote":"Scientists say that {} (walk) for thirty minutes a"}],"distractors":[]},"kind":"gaps","inputMode":"text","sharedOptions":[],"uniqueOptions":false,"segments":[{"type":"text","text":"Scientists say that "},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g1"},{"type":"text","text":"(walk) for thirty minutes a day is one of the simplest ways to stay healthy. You do not need special equipment, and it is "},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g2"},{"type":"text","text":"(complete) free of charge. You can do it almost "},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g3"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":"Walking lowers the risk of heart disease, "},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g4"},{"type":"text","text":"helps people sleep "},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g5"},{"type":"text","text":"(well), and even improves memory. For students, a short walk before study can improve "},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g6"},{"type":"text","text":"(concentrate)."},{"type":"text","text":"Walking also gives you time to think, "},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g7"},{"type":"text","text":"many writers choose to walk when they plan their work."},{"type":"text","text":"Doctors suggest that we should walk "},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g8"},{"type":"text","text":"we can: take the stairs instead of the lift, and get off the bus one stop early. Small changes, repeated daily, make a big "},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g9"},{"type":"text","text":"(different) over time. The key is to start today, "},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g10"},{"type":"text","text":"tomorrow you will find a reason to wait."}],"gaps":[{"id":"g1","label":"第1空","clue":"括号给词 walk：非谓语作主语","options":[],"accepted":["walking"],"explanationZh":"动名词作主语"},{"id":"g2","label":"第2空","clue":"括号给词 complete：副词","options":[],"accepted":["completely"],"explanationZh":"修饰 free"},{"id":"g3","label":"第3空","clue":"无提示词：副词","options":[],"accepted":["anywhere"],"explanationZh":"almost anywhere"},{"id":"g4","label":"第4空","clue":"无提示词：关系代词","options":[],"accepted":["which"],"explanationZh":"非限定性定语从句"},{"id":"g5","label":"第5空","clue":"括号给词 well：比较级","options":[],"accepted":["better"],"explanationZh":"隐含比较"},{"id":"g6","label":"第6空","clue":"括号给词 concentrate：名词","options":[],"accepted":["concentration"],"explanationZh":"improve + 名词"},{"id":"g7","label":"第7空","clue":"无提示词：连词","options":[],"accepted":["so","and"],"explanationZh":"因果"},{"id":"g8","label":"第8空","clue":"无提示词：从句引导词","options":[],"accepted":["wherever","where"],"explanationZh":"地点从句"},{"id":"g9","label":"第9空","clue":"括号给词 different：名词","options":[],"accepted":["difference"],"explanationZh":"make a difference"},{"id":"g10","label":"第10空","clue":"无提示词：连词","options":[],"accepted":["or","otherwise"],"explanationZh":"否则"}],"policy":{"caseSensitive":false,"allowTerminalPunctuation":true}}
